Is game dev SOLVED? I built a whole cyberpunk roguelike shooter without writing a single line of code. Claude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code used MCP servers to drive Meshy, Blender, ElevenLabs and Unity, from my first concept art to a playable Windows build. Then I played it myself and beat ZombieBoss.
